        <mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:26px&quot;&gt;jira-build on AWS: production architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#545B64&quot;&gt;How the application is deployed and which AWS service does what. Web app served from CloudFront and S3; API and background workers on Amazon EKS; Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL as the system of record.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;spacing=4;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
