        <mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;Scaling:&lt;/b&gt; HPA keeps 6 to 60 API pods (indicative); KEDA scales the workers on SQS queue depth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Access:&lt;/b&gt; IRSA gives each pod only the AWS permissions it needs; no static keys.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spread:&lt;/b&gt; topology constraints and PodDisruptionBudgets keep pods in all 3 AZs." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;spacing=4;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="eks">
