        <mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;Release:&lt;/b&gt; a source change starts the Jenkins Core pipeline: build and test, a SonarQube scan whose quality gate must pass, then the image is pushed to JFrog Artifactory. The same pipeline deploys it to EKS as a rolling update; the cluster pulls the image from Artifactory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Database migrations&lt;/b&gt; run as a pre-deploy Kubernetes Job. A failed health check rolls back to the previous image. Jenkins, SonarQube and Artifactory are the company's own build tools, not AWS services." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;spacing=4;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="ci">
